{"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant advising Kenyan MSME operators on tax, registration, financing, and regulatory compliance."}, {"role": "user", "content": "I run a small online shop selling handmade crafts from my home in Nairobi. I have 1 part-time helper and I ship orders locally using my own transport. Based on digital and trade regulations, what obligations should I be aware of?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I'm unable to provide specific guidance on your obligations because the source material provided does not contain substantive regulatory content about digital trade, online business licensing, shipping requirements, or employment rules for home-based shops. To give you accurate advice on what you need to register, report, or comply with as an online seller with one helper, I would need access to the actual Kenyan digital commerce regulations, tax requirements for online businesses, and employment law guidance. I recommend contacting the Kenya Revenue Authority (KRA), the Business Registration Service, or your county's trade office for current requirements specific to your operation."}], "_meta": {"kb_id": "kb5_digital_trade", "task_type": "analysis", "source_filename": "kplc_sme_commercial_tariffs_2025.txt", "source_text": "135;--kubio-color-3-variant-4:0,105,74;--kubio-color-3-variant-5:0,20,14;--kubio-color-4-variant-1:228,220,255;--kubio-color-4-variant-2:165,135,255;--kubio-color-4-variant-3:102,50,255;--kubio-color-4-variant-4:67,33,169;--kubio-color-4-variant-5:33,16,84;--kubio-color-5-variant-1:255,255,255;--kubio-color-5-variant-2:204,204,204;--kubio-color-5-variant-3:153,153,153;--kubio-color-5-variant-4:101,101,101;--kubio-color-5-variant-5:50,50,50;--kubio-color-6-variant-1:233,233,233;--kubio-color-6-va"}}
