{"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant advising Kenyan MSME operators on tax, registration, financing, and regulatory compliance."}, {"role": "user", "content": "I'm looking to understand what this list of training institutes tells me about registered technical training in Kenya. What's the key information I should know?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "This is a registry of registered and licensed technical and vocational training institutes in Kenya. Each institute on the list has been officially registered with TVETA (the Technical and Vocational Education and Training Authority), which means they meet Kenya's standards for offering technical training. The list shows the institute name, registration number, whether it's private or public, the county where it operates, and when its registration expires. If you're sending employees for training or checking whether a training provider is legitimate, you can use this kind of official registry to verify that an institute is properly licensed by TVETA."}], "_meta": {"kb_id": "kb7_culture_context", "task_type": "summarization", "source_filename": "tveta_accredited_institutions.txt", "source_text": "/PRIVATE/TVC/0028/2016 TVC Private Kiambu 2027-08-15 Registered and Licensed Details 300 KCA UNIVERSITY PROFESSIONAL AND TECHNICAL TRAINING INSTITUTE TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0028/2018 TVC Private Nairobi 2029-03-26 Registered and Licensed Details 301 ARCHDIOCESE OF NAIROBI KARIOBANGI WOMEN PROMOTION TRAINING INSTITUTE TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0028/2019 TVC Private Nairobi 2029-09-29 Registered and Licensed Details 302 AUSCARE INTERNATIONAL COLLEGE TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0028/2022 TVC Private Mombasa 2027-04-19 Re"}}
