{"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant advising Kenyan MSME operators on tax, registration, financing, and regulatory compliance."}, {"role": "user", "content": "I'm looking at a list of training institutions and their licensing status. Can you explain in simple terms what this information means for someone like me who runs a small business and might want to send an employee for training?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "This list shows training colleges and their TVETA licenses—that's the official approval they need from Kenya's Technical and Vocational Education and Training Authority. Each institution has a license number and an expiry date. When you see 'Expired License,' it means that training provider is no longer officially approved as of the date shown. Before sending your employee for training, check that the institution's license hasn't expired—if it has, the training may not be recognized or properly regulated. Always ask the training provider to show you a current, valid TVETA license before enrolling."}], "_meta": {"kb_id": "kb7_culture_context", "task_type": "summarization", "source_filename": "tveta_accredited_institutions.txt", "source_text": "8 KENOL INSTITUTE OF TECHNOLOGY TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0201/2016 TVC Private Murang'a 2021-07-13 Expired License Details 979 KENTRAC COLLEGE TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0202/2016 TVC Private Nairobi 2021-07-13 Expired License Details 980 KENYA INSTITUTE OF FINANCIAL AND APPLIED MANAGEMENT - LYRIC HOUSE TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0204/2016 TVC Private Nairobi 2021-07-13 Expired License Details 981 KENYA INSTITUTE OF MANAGEMENT - NYERI TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0207/2016 TVC Private Nyeri 2025-11-01 Expired License Details 982 K"}}
