{"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant advising Kenyan MSME operators on tax, registration, financing, and regulatory compliance."}, {"role": "user", "content": "I'm planning to start a small cosmetology and catering training school in Nakuru. Can you give me a step-by-step checklist of what I need to do to get my TVETA license and keep it current?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Based on TVETA requirements, here's what you need to track:\n\n**Getting Your License:**\n1. Apply for a TVETA Private Training Vocational College (TVC) license\n2. You'll receive a license code in the format TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/[number]/[year]\n3. Your application will be processed and approved\n\n**Keeping Your License Active:**\n1. Note your license expiry date carefully—it will be set for a specific year (e.g., 2025, 2026)\n2. Mark your calendar 6 months before expiry to start renewal planning\n3. Submit your renewal application before the expiry date passes\n4. Do not let your license expire—once expired, you cannot legally operate as a TVETA-registered training institution\n\n**Key Reminder:**\nOnce your license expires, you must renew it before continuing operations. Operating with an expired TVETA license is not permitted. Track your expiry date from day one and build renewal into your annual business calendar."}], "_meta": {"kb_id": "kb7_culture_context", "task_type": "drafting", "source_filename": "tveta_accredited_institutions.txt", "source_text": "cense Details 173 NAIROBI INSTITUTE OF MUSIC AND PERFORMING ARTS TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0030/2019 TVC Private Nairobi 2024-07-09 Expired License Details 174 HOMEBOYZ TRAINING INSTITUTE TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0030/2021 TVC Private Kiambu 2026-04-25 Expired License Details 175 MEDA BUSINESS COLLEGE TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0031/2017 TVC Private Kilifi 2022-02-15 Expired License Details 176 SNIP SNIP SCHOOL OF COSMETOLOGY AND CATERING TVETA/PRIVATE/TVC/0031/2020 TVC Private Nakuru 2025-01-22 Expired License Details"}}
